<title>INDONESIA: Texmaco says Q1 net up to 17.5 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Texmaco says Q1 net up to 17.5 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net income				17.5    vs	9.1</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)		72    vs	 37</p>
<p>    Net sales				115.0    vs     53.9</p>
<p>    Gross profit			    42.8    vs     22.0</p>
<p>    Operating profit			36.3    vs     16.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  24.4    vs     12.9</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were unaudited. Texmaco Perkasa Engineering is a textile machinery manufacturer.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
